Z||000000||sdm1964||05-20-2001||12:15 PM||||Oh yes you know it!!! Jeff makes his way to the reagon and I get to go home on leave!!! I leave for germany tomorrow and will be on the ground in savannah tuesday night. Get to see the wife and kids. Also get to drive my car!!!!! Well the weather is better and it is finally warm. We have been working 9-11 hour days keeping all the stuff rolling. Really not too bad the rooms are nice, food is good. Get 2 free calls a week. 3 tv stations to choose from. But too tired to watch too much tv. Or softball team is 0-2, its all for fun anyway. If 2xses is reading this, Take care buddy, keep your head down and don't count on the internet in the room!!! talk to ya soon!!!!||||reg||1
